	(text "Matched FDA resistor ratios; see sheet 3100.\nPD and VS+ share MAT_ADC_REF." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 91.44 181.61 0) (effects (font (size 1 1) (color 0 70 160 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "139f2349-bb8f-4075-8a54-c459c771620e"))
	(text "U2003 and U2001 share MAT_ADC_REF with the ADC reference.\nSheet 3100 adds balanced attenuation and power-off isolation.\nNominal VDIFF = -0.148935704 x VMON, average about 2.5 V.\nAt VMON = +/-15.75 V, outputs are 1.327...3.673 V and\nFDA input common mode is 1.591...2.920 V. Qualify settling\nand reference loading on the prototype; see v6 report." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 315 77.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25) (color 0 70 160 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "4653e6a6-0906-416b-8756-46991f8eee82"))
	(text "U2006 derives a nominal 12 V input from P15 for U2000. This keeps\nthe ADR4550 input away from its 15 V upper operating boundary. R2010\nprovides the preregulator minimum load; the 5 V reference is not\npowered from ANA5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 42.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.25 1.25)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
