	)
	(text "R2006/R2009 are symmetric 100 Ohm isolation resistors; C2006 is 470\npF C0G between ADC inputs. Differential RC tau is 94 ns. Begin\nvalidation at <=100 kSPS with a 20 us delay after source/range\nchanges. Confirm actual settling and loop stability; these initial\nsettings are not a verified 2 MSPS specification."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 96.8 0)
