	(text "U2002 follows MAT_MONITOR_RAW on P15/N15 before the resistive FDA\nnetwork. Its high-impedance input isolates the selected node from\nthe FDA gain network. Raw CC and ILIM are separately buffered by\nU1903 on sheet 1900; S4/S5 observe those buffered nodes."
