	(text "AD4003 uses MAT_ADC_1V8 for VDD and IO3V3 for its interface.\nCNV, SCK, SDI and SDO retain their U500 connections. R2008 holds\nCNV low; R2007 holds SDI high. Use gain -0.148935704 and\nper-range calibration. REF readiness clears the matrix image." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 315 116.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25) (color 0 70 160 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "f6c095a9-0b07-4453-b0e0-49963f126b13"))
